\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Copy review: superlatives\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 "Leading full-service law firm" and "distinguished reputation" are the most self-promotional lines on the site. Rule 135, Chapter XII of the Pakistan Legal Practitioners and Bar Councils Rules 1976 bars advocates from soliciting work by advertisement while permitting professional cards, nameplates and directory listings limited to qualifications. The partners should read the authoritative rule text and decide; peer practice (e.g. RIAA Barker Gillette Pakistan) names no clients and uses Chambers/Legal 500 citations instead.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
